"EMDB entry including map statistics, contour levels, pixel spacing, "
"dimensions, symmetry, and map file download URLs. Returns technical "
"details essential for map visualization, model fitting, and computational"
" analysis. Use this to prepare for structure visualization in tools like "
"ChimeraX, Coot, or PyMOL."
