"journal articles, preprints, and citations that describe the cryo-EM "
"structure. Returns publication titles, authors, journals, DOIs, PubMed "
"IDs, and abstracts. Use this to find the research papers associated with "
"a structure, understand experimental context, or cite the original work. "
"Use EMDB ID from EMDB\\_search\\_structures or EMDB\\_get\\_structure."
