msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for EMDB structures. Examples:"
" 'ribosome', 'spike protein', 'SARS-CoV-2', 'amyloid', 'ion channel'. "
"Searches titles, descriptions, and molecule names."
msgstr ""

